# Official workflows

The official system-tests workflows are:

- `.github/workflows/system-tests.yml`
- `utils/ci/gitlab/main.yml`
- all other files that may be called by the above

## Job tagging

All jobs executed by these workflows in caller repositories (repositories other than system-tests) **MUST** tag themselves with `ci.framework.name:system-tests`.


